<title>CANADA: Thomson Corp raises quarterly payout.</title>
<headline>Thomson Corp raises quarterly payout.</headline>
<dateline>TORONTO 1996-10-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Thomson Corp said on Tuesday it raised the quarterly dividend on its common shares to US$0.145 from the prior level of US$0.1375.</p>
<p>The dividend is payable on December 16 to holders of common shares of record on November 19, other than holders of related common shares of Thomson Corp Plc who elect equivalent dividends from Thomson Plc in lieu of dividends from Thomson Corp.</p>
<p>This rate of dividend represents a 5.45 percent increase over the rate of dividend paid on September 16.</p>
<p>-- Reuters Toronto Bureau (416) 941-8100</p>
</text>
